    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ember awakens and quickly finds herself in Hell. This is a roguelite shooter that will have you spewing chunks of happiness all over your Dad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/3c790f607f1c10447941b1bbf4e0410c.webp?t=1751577991\" width=616 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/44231d129aea63fd094b73939a3d0648.poster.avif?t=1751577991\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/44231d129aea63fd094b73939a3d0648.webm?t=1751577991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/44231d129aea63fd094b73939a3d0648.mp4?t=1751577991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Descend into gory chambers of Hell inspired by classic horror franchises: it\u2019s pulsating gory, visceral, and just plain gross.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/76721ff0a9b113d176f1b9d57d0bda73.webp?t=1751577991\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/8825faba1fe1d3f48b47071519f6a529.poster.avif?t=1751577991\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/8825faba1fe1d3f48b47071519f6a529.webm?t=1751577991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/8825faba1fe1d3f48b47071519f6a529.mp4?t=1751577991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Butcher the damned of Hell into piles of gore using Ember's chainsaw-gun and other violent and hilarious weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/621f75289f0fa6841ffdfa1f7051ea72.webp?t=1751577991\" width=616 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/bc197eb5d2c1f5cc71fc03b2343820af.poster.avif?t=1751577991\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/bc197eb5d2c1f5cc71fc03b2343820af.webm?t=1751577991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/bc197eb5d2c1f5cc71fc03b2343820af.mp4?t=1751577991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Upgrade bombs and weapons with cursed items and hone your own skills while you dig your way out of Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/4da14f68b102a886d5eaee3bbb4046fe.webp?t=1751577991\" width=616 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/f304410699617533c70c22983aa04d60.poster.avif?t=1751577991\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/f304410699617533c70c22983aa04d60.webm?t=1751577991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/f304410699617533c70c22983aa04d60.mp4?t=1751577991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Annihilate disgusting bosses, garb yourself in their viscera, and discover the truth about Ember's past and the future of reality while maintaining a cool, cute exterior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/b2b3fcb572531ee06ea36d15f21f7730.webp?t=1751577991\" width=616 height=54 /></span>Bespoke gore engine<br>Randomised dungeons <br>Stacks of guns <br>Hundreds of upgrades and synergistic items <br>Hordes of enemy types <br>So many bosses <br>Twin-stick shooter action <br>Roguelite gameplay <br>Collectible stickers <br>Discounted therapy appointments <br>Maladaptive parenting practices </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
